+# LUMOS v3.2.6 Release Notes
+
+Date: 2026-07-29
+
+## Summary
+
+This patch refines the experimental `home-spiral.html` presentation by removing the film-strip history, intensifying the ambient geometric background, further reducing animation overhead, and tightening scene spacing.
+
+## Changes
+
+- Removed the three-dimensional film-strip / frame ribbon from the spiral Home experiment.
+- Increased the strength and visibility of the background glow, blueprint grid, axes, triangular core, and surrounding luminous shapes.
+- Reduced lag further through lighter runtime motion work, simplified filter usage, and reduced particle count with stronger nebula-style glow.
+- Shortened spacing between scenes and reduced the total pinned scroll distance for a slightly faster sequence.
+
+## Scope
+
+No model equations, scientific assumptions, optimization logic, datasets, workspaces, or public research pages changed.
